<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD FINAL SCORE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD FINAL SCORE.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Queensland were 266</p>
<p>for four at close of play on the first day of the five-day</p>
<p>Sheffield Shield final against Western Australia at the WACA</p>
<p>Ground on Friday.</p>
<p>Score - Queensland 266 for four (Matthew Mott 86, Stuart Law</p>
<p>70, Trevor Barsby 67) v Western Australia.</p>
</text>
